        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage B571, Restroom Door Occupancy Indicator Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Schlage restroom occupancy indicator door bolt is for use on commercial and office bathroom doors. The deadbolt is thrown or retracted by an inside thumb turn unit. The occupancy indicator on the outside reads either <b>\"In Use\"</b> or <b>\"Vacant\"</b>. Easy to install, this Schlage deadbolt is adjustable to fit either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of Schlage B571 Privacy Door Bolt:\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap\"></a>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 1-3/8 to 1-3/4\" thick doors.</li>\r\n<li>Universal deadbolt fits both 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\" backsets. </li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door preparations. </li>\r\n<li>ANSI Grade 2.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass trim.</li>\r\n<li>ADA compliant.</li>\r\n<li>Includes <a href=\"/products/schlage-61-509-emergency-release-key-for-b571\">Safety Release Key</a> for opening locked doors in emergency cases.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Privacy door bolt uses a Thumbturn inside and has Occupancy Indicator outside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Restroom Occupancy Indicator Door Bolt, Schlage B571",
                "description": "Schlage B571 Restroom Door Occupancy Indicator Lock - The Schlage restroom occupancy indicator door bolt is for use on commercial and office bathroom doors. The deadbolt is thrown or retracted by an inside thumb turn unit. The occupancy indicator on the outside reads either In Use or Vacant. Easy to install, this Schlage deadbolt is adjustable to fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n",
